  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### CIS Bulk Emails\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 15 Aug, 2023 at 10:20 AM\n\n\t\tNavigation:\n\nBookkeeping >> Select Client >> CIS >> CIS300\n\nAlternatively, click here to be redirected.\n\nAfter navigating to this page, select any period that you want to send across, as shown on the screenshot below. \n\nIf you have any subcontractors with emails fields that are empty, the following prompt will appear. \n\nIf the fields are filled properly then you will get a prompt with the email sent message. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
